{{!
    @template local_groupdist/bulkedit_footer

    Sticky footer of the bulk edit page: save (chunked via web service) and
    the way back to group management. Action buttons only — the unsaved
    changes counter is page content and lives in the toolbar.

    There is no cancel here on purpose: saving writes through a web service
    as it goes, so by the time this footer is reached there is nothing a
    cancel could undo. Leaving with unsaved cells is confirmed by the AMD
    module instead.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * returnurl - the group management page URL

    Example context (json):
    {
        "returnurl": "https://example.com/group/index.php?id=2"
    }
}}
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 w-100">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="save" disabled>
        {{#str}} savechanges, core {{/str}}
    </button>
    <a href="{{returnurl}}" class="btn btn-secondary" data-action="backtogroups">
        {{#str}} backtogroups, local_groupdist {{/str}}
    </a>
</div>
